def privacy():
    body='''<main id="main"><section class="page-hero" id="top"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Website information</p><h1>A straightforward<br>portfolio.</h1></div></section><div class="container privacy-copy"><h2>Contacting me</h2><p>When enabled, the contact form sends your name, reply email, chosen topic, and message to Braj through the hosting mail service. Messages are not stored in the website database. Cloudflare Turnstile processes verification information to help prevent automated abuse. Temporary, salted identifiers derived from IP and email addresses enforce rate limits; expired entries are removed on subsequent requests. Hosting and email providers may retain their own operational records. You can also contact Braj using the direct email, WhatsApp, or LinkedIn links.</p><h2>Site features</h2><p>This site does not add analytics trackers or advertising scripts. Essential session cookies protect contact submissions and owner sign-in. Turnstile loads near the enabled contact form. Hosting providers may process ordinary request information to serve and protect the website. The font and visual assets are hosted with the site.</p><p>The site summarizes its hosting access logs to estimate daily traffic and referral sources. The reporting database uses daily keyed identifiers and stores counts without raw IP addresses, user agents, or referral URLs. This reporting uses no browser tracking script or analytics cookie.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Project links, archive references, LinkedIn, and WhatsApp take you to external services with their own privacy practices. Historical project references describe earlier contributions and may differ from the current state of those websites.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about the website or information presented here, email <a href="mailto:brajkishorpandey@gmail.com">brajkishorpandey@gmail.com</a>.</p><p style="margin-top:30px">Updated November 2026.</p></div></main>'''
    (OUT/'privacy.html').write_text(head('Privacy & website information','How this professional portfolio handles its contact form, local assets, and links to external services.','/privacy.html')+nav()+body+footer())

